        "content": "## MCP - Google Drive OCR (RFC-040 Async Support)\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/google-drive-ocr\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `google_access_token` (required): Google OAuth2 access token\n- `mistral_api_key` (required for OCR): Mistral API key\n- `folder_id` (string): List files in folder\n- `file_id` (string): Process specific file with OCR\n- `max_files` (int): Max files to list (default: 100)\n- `include_images` (bool): Include base64 images in OCR response\n- `callback_url` (string): URL for async callback (RFC-040)\n- `job_id` (string): Optional job ID for async tracking\n\n**Sync Mode:** Omit `callback_url` for synchronous response\n\n**Async Mode (RFC-040):**\n- Provide `callback_url` to receive 202 Accepted immediately\n- Result POSTed to callback_url with HMAC signature\n- Header: X-N8N-Signature (HMAC-SHA256 of payload)\n\n**API:** Mistral OCR (mistral-ocr-latest) + Google Drive v3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-note-async",
      "name": "Async Flow Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "## RFC-040 Async Callback Pattern\n\n1. Client sends request with `callback_url`\n2. Server responds immediately with 202 + job_id\n3. Processing continues in background\n4. Result POSTed to callback_url with:\n   - Content-Type: application/json\n   - X-N8N-Signature: HMAC-SHA256(payload)"
      }
    }
